  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "AmharicCLIP-annotation",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tAmharicCLIP Annotation Dataset\n\t\n\n69,629 images organized by category for Amharic caption annotation.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tStructure\n\t\n\nimages/\n    animals10/        18,644 images \u2014 10 animal classes\n        cat/\n        dog/\n        horse/ ...\n    intel/            11,998 images \u2014 6 scene classes\n        forest/\n        mountain/ ...\n    fruits360/        38,987 images \u2014 131 fruit classes\n        apple/\n        banana/ ...\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tImage URL Format\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/CLIPAMharic/AmharicCLIP-annotation.",
